WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 a50eb6189c3de32cc6a17ee23be96f14

00:00:00.462 --> 00:00:05.581
Habari. Hili ni zoezi la
kwanza katika Jiki ambalo

00:00:05.902 --> 00:00:08.381
watu wengi hukwama nalo kabisa.

00:00:09.422 --> 00:00:12.862
Nadhani kuna mazoezi mengine ambayo watu
hukwama nayo kisha wanapata njia ya kuyamaliza.

00:00:13.102 --> 00:00:18.382
Hili ni zoezi la kwanza ambalo, nadhani,
watu mara nyingi hupata shida nalo.

00:00:19.181 --> 00:00:20.821
Basi sijui kama umelitatua.

00:00:20.821 --> 00:00:24.181
Kama umelitatua, hongera.
Kama hujalitatua,

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:27.501
kama uko katikati, umetazama
vidokezo na bado huwezi kulitatua,

00:00:27.501 --> 00:00:31.852
na kwa hiyo unatazama video hii ili ujue
jinsi ya kulitatua, hilo ni sawa kabisa.

00:00:31.852 --> 00:00:35.051
Nitakueleza hatua kwa hatua
jinsi ninavyolitatua zoezi hili.

00:00:35.292 --> 00:00:39.212
Tukifika mahali ambapo
nimekufungulia njia, ukasema, sawa,

00:00:39.212 --> 00:00:42.612
nimeelewa sasa, naweza kwenda
kulimaliza, simamisha video, ulimalize.

00:00:42.612 --> 00:00:45.292
Na unaweza kutazama sehemu
iliyobaki ya video baadaye.

00:00:46.082 --> 00:00:49.731
Lakini hebu twende polepole.
Basi tunachojaribu kufanya hapa,

00:00:49.731 --> 00:00:51.771
tunajaribu kujenga mtu wa theluji.

00:00:52.621 --> 00:00:55.771
Tumeshajenga mtu wa theluji
katika zoezi lililopita,

00:00:55.771 --> 00:01:00.731
lakini safari hii tunajaribu kujenga mtu wa
theluji kwa kutumia variable moja ya size

00:01:01.031 --> 00:01:02.712
ambayo kila kitu kingine kinategemea.

00:01:02.951 --> 00:01:06.552
Na kisha tunapobadilisha variable
ya size, kama unavyoona hapa,

00:01:06.552 --> 00:01:10.311
mtu wa theluji anakua kutoka
mdogo sana hadi mkubwa zaidi.

00:01:11.912 --> 00:01:16.311
Basi nimekupa snowman X
hii na nimekupa size hii.

00:01:16.632 --> 00:01:17.992
Zote mbili ni

00:01:19.191 --> 00:01:23.432
variable zilizofungwa. Ingawa hii unaweza
kuibadilisha iwe chochote unachotaka.

00:01:24.061 --> 00:01:25.831
Lakini tunaanza nayo ikiwa nne.

00:01:27.841 --> 00:01:32.322
Basi mambo ya kawaida yanatumika. Upande wa
juu kushoto wa eneo la kuchora ni 0, 0 huku juu

00:01:32.481 --> 00:01:35.921
na upande wa chini kulia wa
eneo hilo ni 100 huku chini.

00:01:37.441 --> 00:01:40.962
Kama nilivyosema, unazo variable hizi za
snowman na size zilizoandikwa tayari.

00:01:40.962 --> 00:01:45.602
Lakini hili ndilo jambo muhimu. Unahitaji
kukokotoa variable nyingine zote

00:01:45.921 --> 00:01:49.721
kwa kutumia semi za hesabu.
Hiyo ni sentensi ngumu kidogo.

00:01:49.721 --> 00:01:52.962
Labda baadaye nitarudi na kujaribu
kuandika sentensi hiyo kwa

00:01:53.281 --> 00:01:56.081
Kiingereza kizuri zaidi kidogo. Lakini
hebu tufikiri inamaanisha nini.

00:01:57.201 --> 00:02:02.242
Inamaanisha nini kukokotoa variable?
Linasikika kama jambo gumu.

00:02:02.402 --> 00:02:06.721
Linamaanisha tu kwamba tutachukua
variable ya size hapa, nne,

00:02:06.962 --> 00:02:10.481
na tutasema kwamba variable
nyingine zote ni kitu kama,

00:02:10.972 --> 00:02:15.201
size mara tano au size ikigawanywa kwa mbili.

00:02:15.521 --> 00:02:20.241
Kwa hiyo variable nyingine zinatumia
size kama sehemu ya hesabu zao.

00:02:20.562 --> 00:02:22.162
Hicho tu ndicho tunachomaanisha kwa kukokotoa

00:02:23.162 --> 00:02:25.961
na semi za hesabu.
Kujumlisha, kutoa, kugawanya,

00:02:27.081 --> 00:02:30.201
kuzidisha. Kisha tuna
sheria chache tulizopewa.

00:02:30.201 --> 00:02:33.801
Nusukipenyo cha kichwa ni size mara mbili.

00:02:33.801 --> 00:02:38.122
Sawa, kwa hiyo tunaweza kuandika tu kwamba
nusukipenyo cha kichwa ni size mara 2,

00:02:38.681 --> 00:02:45.162
nusukipenyo cha mwili ni size mara 3, na
nusukipenyo cha msingi ni size mara 4.

00:02:46.521 --> 00:02:51.592
Sawa, tayari tunazo hapa chini mistari
ya msimbo inayochora maduara haya.

00:02:52.111 --> 00:02:57.301
Basi tunaweza kuendesha msimbo wetu,
tukatazama kidogo, na tunaona tuna,

00:02:57.701 --> 00:02:59.141
tukirudi mwanzoni,

00:03:00.102 --> 00:03:01.981
tunaziunda hizi zote moja baada ya nyingine.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:04.741
Kwa sasa, zote zimekaa tu
kwenye nafasi hizi za sifuri.

00:03:04.901 --> 00:03:08.581
Lakini tukichora kichwa, tunaona
duara dogo likitokea juu hapa.

00:03:08.741 --> 00:03:12.181
Na tukichora mwili,
tunaona duara kubwa zaidi.

00:03:12.181 --> 00:03:15.141
Na kisha tukichora msingi,
tunaona duara kubwa kweli.

00:03:15.622 --> 00:03:18.021
Basi nitakukumbusha
tena, tumia kila wakati

00:03:18.102 --> 00:03:20.181
kitelezi hiki hapa chini na
upitie mambo hatua kwa hatua.

00:03:20.181 --> 00:03:21.861
Kwa kweli kinarahisisha maisha yako sana.

00:03:22.951 --> 00:03:24.312
Sawa, basi,

00:03:25.671 --> 00:03:28.951
agizo linalofuata. Maduara
yanapaswa kugusana.

00:03:29.271 --> 00:03:34.151
Mwili unakaa moja kwa moja juu ya msingi, na
kichwa kinakaa moja kwa moja juu ya mwili.

00:03:34.872 --> 00:03:37.352
Unaweza kuona hilo katika picha hizi hapa.

00:03:37.512 --> 00:03:43.111
Tuna msingi mkubwa unaogusa mwili wa
wastani, nao unagusa kichwa cha wastani.

00:03:44.312 --> 00:03:50.401
Na jambo la mwisho ni kwamba sehemu ya chini
ya msingi iko umbali wa size kutoka chini.

00:03:50.562 --> 00:03:55.361
Sawa, kwa hiyo tunahitaji kufikiri
kidogo kuhusu tunachofanya hapa.

00:03:55.762 --> 00:03:57.722
Basi tunasema kwamba tunataka.

00:03:57.722 --> 00:03:59.282
Na tunataka kujenga kuanzia chini.

00:03:59.282 --> 00:04:04.521
Hilo ni muhimu sana. Sehemu ya chini ya duara
la msingi iko umbali wa size kutoka chini.

00:04:04.521 --> 00:04:06.401
Kwa hiyo tunahitaji kujenga kuanzia chini.

00:04:07.282 --> 00:04:11.002
Basi sehemu ya chini ya msingi. Sehemu ya, chini ya.

00:04:11.002 --> 00:04:16.072
Ndiyo, sehemu ya chini ya msingi itakuwa
100, ambayo ni chini kabisa hapa,

00:04:16.471 --> 00:04:19.672
ukiondoa size. Basi tunaweza kuanza na hilo.

00:04:20.151 --> 00:04:23.341
Hilo litatupa sehemu ya
chini ya duara hili.

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:28.911
Lakini ukikumbuka, ukishuka
chini na kuangalia maelezo ya

00:04:28.911 --> 00:04:32.391
jinsi ya kuchora duara,
tunapaswa kubainisha kitovu.

00:04:33.112 --> 00:04:36.151
Basi tunabainisha namba mbili za
kitovu, nusukipenyo na rangi.

00:04:36.471 --> 00:04:42.541
Kwa hiyo tukiwa na 100 hapa chini,
kisha tukapanda kidogo kwa size, basi

00:04:42.942 --> 00:04:47.262
tunahitaji kuweka kitovu kiwe umbali
wa nusukipenyo, yaani umbali huu.

00:04:47.742 --> 00:04:50.942
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kusema ukiondoa nusukipenyo cha msingi.

00:04:51.982 --> 00:04:55.101
Basi fikiri kuhusu
hili. Tuna 100 chini,

00:04:55.502 --> 00:04:57.661
ukiondoa size ili kukisukuma juu kidogo.

00:04:57.822 --> 00:05:01.822
Na kisha tunataka kuweka kitovu, ambacho
kiko umbali wa nusukipenyo cha msingi.

00:05:02.302 --> 00:05:06.141
Tukifanya hivi, sasa
tunaona tuna duara chini.

00:05:07.351 --> 00:05:11.031
Sawa, sasa tunahitaji kusogeza
mwili ili uguse duara hili.

00:05:11.752 --> 00:05:15.432
Mantiki ileile inatumika.
Kama tungesema, sawa, basi,

00:05:15.591 --> 00:05:19.992
Y ya mwili ni Y ya msingi,
hiyo ingeuweka tu juu yake.

00:05:20.791 --> 00:05:26.471
Kwa hiyo tunahitaji kuusogeza juu kwa umbali
huu, nusukipenyo cha msingi, hadi hapa.

00:05:26.632 --> 00:05:28.151
Na kisha tunahitaji kuusogeza juu tena

00:05:30.312 --> 00:05:33.831
kwa nusukipenyo chake chenyewe.
Basi tunaweza kusema, sawa, hii ni.

00:05:34.041 --> 00:05:38.762
Hii ni Y ya msingi ukiondoa nusukipenyo
cha msingi, ukiondoa nusukipenyo cha mwili.

00:05:39.802 --> 00:05:42.841
Hiyo itauweka hapa. Na
kisha tuna kimoja zaidi.

00:05:43.081 --> 00:05:46.841
Kama hukufanya hivi, simamisha
video kwa sekunde moja na ufikirie

00:05:48.471 --> 00:05:50.041
jinsi hasa ungefanya hili.

00:05:51.482 --> 00:05:55.562
Basi tuna. Fikiria tunachukua
kichwa na kukiweka katikati.

00:05:55.562 --> 00:05:58.482
Kichwa kinaanzia kwenye Y ya mwili.

00:05:58.482 --> 00:05:59.641
Kwa hiyo kimechorwa hapa.

00:06:00.992 --> 00:06:02.992
Tunahitaji kukisogeza juu kwa umbali huu.

00:06:03.711 --> 00:06:08.351
Hicho ni nusukipenyo cha mwili. Na kisha
tunahitaji kukisogeza juu kwa umbali huu.

00:06:08.591 --> 00:06:13.471
Na hicho ni nusukipenyo cha kichwa. Ni vilevile, ukiondoa
nusukipenyo cha mwili na nusukipenyo cha kichwa.

00:06:15.151 --> 00:06:17.471
Na kisha hiyo itatupa mtu wa theluji.

00:06:17.552 --> 00:06:20.351
Sasa, jambo muhimu ni variable hii ya size.

00:06:20.591 --> 00:06:24.831
Sasa tunaweza kubadilisha variable ya size
kuwa mbili, na mtu wa theluji anakuwa mdogo.

00:06:24.831 --> 00:06:26.192
Na kila kitu kinahusiana.

00:06:27.002 --> 00:06:29.882
Tukibadilisha hii kuwa 3, kila kitu kinahusiana.

00:06:30.201 --> 00:06:33.721
Tukibadilisha hii kuwa 5,
kila kitu bado kinahusiana.

00:06:34.922 --> 00:06:36.841
Kwa hiyo hakuna uchawi unaotokea hapa.

00:06:36.841 --> 00:06:39.802
Hakuna kitu kilichobandikwa
kwenye kingine.

00:06:40.122 --> 00:06:42.880
Tunachukua tu thamani ya size.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.922
Tunatoa namba kutoka kwenye sanduku hilo,

00:06:45.721 --> 00:06:48.442
tunafanya hesabu nayo,
tunaizidisha kwa mbili,

00:06:48.442 --> 00:06:51.002
na kisha tunaiweka kwenye sanduku
jipya linaloitwa head radius.

00:06:51.322 --> 00:06:54.281
Na kisha hapa chini,
tunapokokotoa head Y,

00:06:54.362 --> 00:06:58.362
tunaangalia tu ndani ya sanduku hilo
na kutoa chochote kilichokuwa ndani.

00:06:58.521 --> 00:07:01.081
Na unaweza kuona hili ukipitia hatua kwa hatua.

00:07:01.882 --> 00:07:04.601
Taarifa hizi upande wa kulia
zinakuwa muhimu sana hapa.

00:07:04.601 --> 00:07:07.161
Nakushauri sana
uchukue muda kuzisoma.

00:07:07.961 --> 00:07:12.122
Unaona, hapa tunakuambia kilichotokea
kwenye mstari huu wa msimbo.

00:07:12.362 --> 00:07:14.762
Tumeunda variable mpya inayoitwa head Y.

00:07:15.242 --> 00:07:18.762
Unaona, unaweza kuweka kielekezi juu
yake. Na inaonyesha hasa tunachokiangazia,

00:07:19.002 --> 00:07:22.041
yaani head Y. Na tunaweka
thamani yake kuwa 15.

00:07:23.502 --> 00:07:26.781
Tulichukua body Y kutoka
rafuni, tukapata 40.

00:07:26.781 --> 00:07:29.262
Tukachukua body radius, tukapata 15.

00:07:29.742 --> 00:07:33.701
Kisha tukafanya 40 kutoa 15.
Unaona tunaangazia sehemu hii yote

00:07:33.701 --> 00:07:35.101
ili ukumbuke hii ni nini.

00:07:35.341 --> 00:07:39.422
Tukapata 25. Kisha tukachukua
head radius, tukapata 10.

00:07:39.581 --> 00:07:42.221
Na kisha tukafanya 25 kutoa 10, tukapata 15.

00:07:42.622 --> 00:07:45.982
Kisha tukaunda sanduku hili
jipya na kuweka 15 ndani yake.

00:07:47.101 --> 00:07:47.502
Basi

00:07:49.552 --> 00:07:53.951
maelezo haya yanakusaidia sana,
yanakuambia hasa kinachoendelea.

00:07:53.951 --> 00:07:58.591
Mfano rahisi kama huu, ambapo
tulichukua size, tukafanya 5 mara 4,

00:07:58.752 --> 00:08:00.711
tukapata 20. Kisha tukaunda sanduku jipya.

00:08:00.711 --> 00:08:04.911
Tukaiweka kwenye sanduku. Nakushauri
sana, ukikwama, punguza mwendo,

00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:08.752
pitia kwa kitelezi, angalia
taarifa hizi upande wa kulia,

00:08:08.752 --> 00:08:13.271
unaona hapa pia tuna kitendakazi
cha circle chenye snowman X, ambayo

00:08:13.271 --> 00:08:16.721
ina 50 ndani, head Y yenye
15, head radius yenye 10.

00:08:16.721 --> 00:08:19.641
Kwa hiyo unaweza kuona hapa
hasa hii inakuwa nini.

00:08:19.641 --> 00:08:22.081
Inakuwa 50, 15, 10, white.

00:08:22.961 --> 00:08:26.322
Basi nakushauri sana punguza
mwendo, uliangalie hili kwa makini.

00:08:26.891 --> 00:08:29.442
Hata hivyo, natumaini
umefanikiwa kulitatua zoezi hili.

00:08:29.442 --> 00:08:32.481
Hongera kama
umefanikiwa kulitatua.

00:08:33.121 --> 00:08:37.442
Na ndiyo, sasa unatumia
hesabu, unatumia variable.

00:08:37.601 --> 00:08:39.522
Haya ni mambo mazuri. Hizi
ndizo nguzo za msingi.

00:08:39.522 --> 00:08:42.481
Sasa tutaenda kujenga vitu vingine
vizuri sana kwa kutumia haya.

00:08:42.802 --> 00:08:45.081
Asante kwa kutazama. Natumaini
utafurahia somo linalofuata.

00:08:45.081 --> 00:08:45.802
Kwaheri kwa sasa.
